  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The spring-mass system oscillates in SHM. Its time period is given by</p><p><math><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>When spring is cut in ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, the new spring constant is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8203;/2</mo></math>&nbsp;(for the longer part)</p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>'</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mi>k</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>'</mo><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mi>T</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
